///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
:START
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
:TITLE  Critical Mass
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

:SHORT_TEXT_START
Nuclear reactors, built in Myanmar and Thailand by Russia and Canada allowed rivaling countries to conduct secret research of atomic weapons. When threat of full scale war became a reality, Russia and NATO sent  troops to protect their personnel and technology. Meanwhile, fear that their opponent will make a breakthrough in nuclear research first, became the most important factor for decision makers.
 
Destroy enemy research center and capture weapons prototypes, prepared for a test at secret  military base!
:TEXT_END

:CAMPAIGN_DATA
   :FILENAME ..\COMMON\MAPS\MAP1\RAFop01\BURMA.SID
   :FILENAME ..\COMMON\MAPS\MAP1\RAFop01\BURMA.BIN
   
   :MAP_X_SIZE 90
   :MAP_Z_SIZE 100
   :MAP_SECTOR_SIZE 4096
   
   :FACTION
   :SIDE SIDE_BLUE_FORCE
   :COLOUR COL_BLUE
   
   :FACTION
   :SIDE SIDE_RED_FORCE
   :COLOUR COL_RED
   
   :END

:CAMPAIGN_REQUIRES_APACHE_HAVOC 1

///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
:FACTION
:SIDE SIDE_BLUE_FORCE
:COLOUR COL_BLUE
:ATTITUDE FORCE_ATTITUDE_NORMAL
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

